{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 77119, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 55252, "uid": 75614, "type": 4, "title": "天命之子韩服buff与技能机制综述", "tag": "", "created_at": 1622356816, "updated_at": 1674561544, "updated_uid": 75614, "comment_at": 1674624031, "last_at": 1692516904, "comment_count": 18, "status": 1, "summary": "1.前言在天命之子游戏中，刚入坑的的萌新往往会头疼于角色挑选，阵容搭配，技能设置等问题。我应该练哪些角色？为什么练这些角色？不同活动，阵容应该怎么搭配？技能应该如何设置？本攻略针对此类问题，从游戏机制", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 61, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 32172, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 30, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 77119, "content": "<div id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></div></span></div><div id=\"true\"><font color=\"#333333\"><br></font></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">1.前言</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></p></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">&nbsp; 在天命之子游戏中，刚入坑的的萌新往往会头疼于角色挑选，阵容搭配，技能设置等问题。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">我应该练哪些角色？为什么练这些角色？不同活动，阵容应该怎么搭配？技能应该如何设置？</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">本攻略针对此类问题，从游戏机制方面着手，进行科普的同时，让读者能够通过学习形成自己的配队思路，从而更快地登堂入室。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">（本文所写内容均由个人测试，难免有所缺漏，如有缺错请理性讨论</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">）</span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">2.技能基础机制说明</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></p></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">天命之子中，天子的攻击方式分为：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">①普通攻击<span style=\"\">②重击【N】<span style=\"\">③滑动攻击【S】<span style=\"\">④必杀技【ds】</span></span></span></span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">&nbsp; 其中，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">普通攻击是</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">天子自动释放的，无法人为操纵</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">。重击和滑动攻击，可以选择释放，释放的区别为——</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">重击轻点天子头像后释放，不翻面；而滑动攻击为按住天子头像上滑进行释放，释放结束后天子进入翻面状态</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">【小知识：当天子进入翻面状态下，天子不受任何技能加速影响，固定读秒（光琴除外，其可以强行结束天子翻面状态）】</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(15, 36, 62);\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(15, 36, 62);\">&nbsp; 必杀技通过前面三种攻击模式，且受敌方天子攻击时，进行充能，当能量条满时可选择天子点击释放。而且必杀技释放会给</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">“狂热时间”</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">【俗称ft，Fever Time】</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(15, 36, 62);\">充能，充能满后进入连击模式，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">可选择天子进行连击，方式为按住或者连点天子头像<span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">【小知识：在ft模式下，选定天子打击敌方固定70下，伤害由重击伤害决定，速度由点击频率决定】</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">目前在韩服中，天子的技能攻击方式分为三种：</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">多段攻击</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（技能描述为对x名敌人造成x段伤害），</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">百分比攻击</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（技能描述为对x名敌人造成x（x%）伤害），</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">全体攻击</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（对全体敌人造成x伤害）</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">很多萌新主要的疑惑在于固伤刀与百分比刀的区别，为什么百分比天子要用白攻石头？为什么在wb中，百分比天子的表现要远高于固伤刀？</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">原因其实出在伤害公式上，拿滑动攻击举例，在百分百破防情况下，韩服固伤刀的基础伤害公式可以简化为：<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（技能攻击力伤害项+面板攻击力伤害项）x伤害增量总项</span>，百分比刀为：<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">面板攻击力x固定系数x百分比幅度x伤害增量总项，</span>你可以发现的是不同于固伤刀，百分比刀技能攻击力伤害项是从括号里面拿出来，在总项上相乘，也就是说，加成伤害的buff，百分比刀都能直接吃满，这也导致了单纯的加攻就能极大提升百分比刀的伤害。（同时说明了为什么技能攻击力对于固伤刀加成很小）</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">--<b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-</span></b><b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-</span></b></span></b></span></b><br></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">如果在数学上进行推导：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:24px;background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:start;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">固伤刀的buff是：<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">（技能攻击力伤害项+面板攻击力伤害项）x伤害增量总项</span>，即</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">（a+b）</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">*c</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">，而百分比刀是：</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">面板攻击力x固定系数x百分比幅度x伤害增量总项</span>，即</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">a*b</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">*c</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">，又因为总项c不可能为负数，a与b的值均大于1</span><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:24px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:start;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;background:transparent;text-align:start;font-weight:700;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:start;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:start;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">所以解得：</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">设a=1+M b=1+N。那么a+b=2+M+N</span></div><p style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:start;\">ab=（1+M）（1+N）=1+ M+N+MN，</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:start;\">由于a&gt;1,b&gt;1所以M,N都不小于0，<span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">MN不为零且大于1，即</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:start;\">1+M+N+MN&gt;2+M+N</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:start;\">即 ab&gt;a+b</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:start;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">所以百分比刀的buff能力要强于固伤刀</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">，至于强多少，可以将不等式放缩后，通过检验固定数值来描绘伤害曲线，<span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">不过可以预测，当基础百分比数值(x%</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">)不足时，没有buff或者buff幅度不够的百分比刀伤害还是远低于固伤刀，不清楚可以自行了解</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">求线性目标函数在线性约束条件下的最大值或最小值问题</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:start;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><br></span></p></span></div></span></span></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">3.buff基础机制说明</span></span></p></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">不同的天子拥有着不同的攻击技能，不同的技能会产生不同种类的buff。<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">【小知识：buff是一个英文词汇，原意是指增益。在DC中分两类，指正面的增益效果和负面的减益效果（debuff）】</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-</span></b><b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-</span></b></span></b><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">一.</span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 对于负面buff，</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">也就是debuff，在pvp或者活动中，通过限制敌方天子或者boss，来增强己方天子的保护与制造伤害的能力</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">【需要特别注意的是，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">&nbsp;天命之子的暴击机制不同于普通的MMORPG游戏机制，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">无论上阵多少天子，一次的暴击状态只能由一位天子触发，并且当达到一定时限后，暴击状态会消失，此时出手不会触发暴击，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">因此，如韩服雷萍具有的暴击抑制，虽然是抑制除刀以外的天子暴击率，却属于增益buff。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">】</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span>负面buff主要可以分为六种：<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">①造成持续伤害【如分解，中毒】</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">②减少目标一个或者多种防御属性【如乱舞之刃，强击】<span style=\"\">③限制敌方的技能条转速【如眩晕，时间逆行，沉默】<span style=\"\">④增加敌方负面buff作用【如诅咒增幅，减益时间延长】<span style=\"\">⑤解除或夺取敌方buff【如解除无敌，增益爆发】<span style=\"\">⑥削弱伤害</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">【ps：需要注意的是，减少目标的防御属性中，如强击，弱点防御下降等，都属于<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">伤害增量总项</span>，加算后再与总项进行乘算（同理弱点防御上升也为加算，数值为负），而不是对防御项进行削弱】</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></b><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">二.</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 对于正面buff，在pvp或者活动中，通过增强己方天子，来达到提升保护与制造伤害的能力<br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\">正面buff主要可以分为：</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;text-align:start;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;\">①提升伤害【如双刃剑，应援，集中】</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;text-align:start;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;\">②提升防御相关属性【如不死，伪无敌，反射，回复等】<span style=\"\">③提升技能条转速【如扭曲时间】<span style=\"\">④解除负面buff作用【如清除】</span></span></span><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">【ps：只考虑主体buff种类，并且很多buff属于复合buff，拥有多种效果】</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; font-size: 20px;\"><b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-<b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-<b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">-</span></b></span></b></span></b></span></b><br></span></span></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">三.</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">&nbsp; 最后针对buff，要特别强调三个问题，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一是buff叠加问题，二是优先级问题，三是时间问题。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">对于叠加问题，其主要出现在pve中，玩家需要看技能描述，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">如果技能描述一致，说明存在叠加，同时上场只会有一个buff生效。而如果技能描述不一致，则说明可以叠加。</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">拿最经典的加速来说，“技能条填充量增加”，“技能条填充速度增加”，“技能填充量充能”，“时间扭曲”，它们的作用看似相同，但是技能描述不同，图标也不一样，因此可以叠加。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">对于优先级来说，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">必杀技＞滑动攻击＞重击，并且不可逆，也就是说如果先释放了必杀技，再释放滑动攻击，必杀技的buff效果仍然存在，不会被滑动攻击覆盖。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">对于时间问题，玩家需要知道，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">天命之子中的“回合数”，既不是指固定时间，也不是全体天子的总共出手频率，而是指单个天子的出手次数，自动攻击一次，算作一回合，因此buff对每个天子的作用时间并不固定。同时由此也可推出，上阵天子的数量越多，buff作用单个天子的时间也会越长，例如wb的buff时间就远长于raid，技能设置也随之要改变。</span></div></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"></span></div></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">4.选择角色思路</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></p></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">了解以上基础知识后，对于配队应该有了大致上的思路，不同的场景，不同的目标，天子的选择也会不同。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">&nbsp; 例如raid，只有五个位置，其实就是考虑选取加速，保命，增加伤害的天子，来达到5min打出最高的输出</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">【冷知识：</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">关于队伍站位，萌新需要知道的是，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">在ft结束后，所有天子的技能都处于充能完毕状态，并且会</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">从左往右释放技能</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">因此在raid中，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">优先把奶or盾放到左手第一位，加速和双刃放在中间，刀放到最右侧</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">，这样可以</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">1.保证ft后回复被消耗的血量2.刀在吃满buff后释放技能，伤害更高。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（高练度玩家可将刀放在左手第一位，防止掉暴击）</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">】</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">&nbsp; 而对于wb，<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">也就是如何叠加不重复的增伤buff，并且通过debuff限制boss，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">同时调整攻击力，使关键天子能吃到加速buff</span>，最终能够打出理论上的最高输出。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">&nbsp; 至于pvp，比较复杂，要根据当前环境，自己的练度，搭配好的队伍合理上分，鉴于韩服缝合怪阵容较为稳定，最关键是保值率也非常高，因此这方面我就不赘述了，萌新完全可以抄榜上阵容。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">5.尾言</span></p></div><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">有人说，玩个游戏，值得这么认真么？有了活动直接抄攻略他不香么？</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 对此，我想说的是，一方面，大部分人的练度不可能和攻略完全契合，这时候需要自己思考怎么配队提升，大佬不可能手把手教你。另一方面，多学学游戏知识，也是培养自己的钻研精神，如果凡事都浮于表面，到头来难免有点一事无成的空虚落寂吧【已硕士毕业の科研渣渣の感触】</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:start;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">——ID：xiaoxin</font></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">2021.5.30</font></p></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:start;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-